<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Example of multimodal RAG effectiveness: Qwen2-VL produces a more accurate answer when provided with the slide as an image rather than as plain text. Viewing the slide image preserves the visual context, specifically, <span id="S6.F3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">the arrows illustrating the temporal scope of <span id="S6.F3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">usability</span> and <span id="S6.F3.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">user experience</span></span>.</figcaption>
